{{ define "bootstrap_admin_help" }}
{{ template "partials/header" . }}
<section class="card oz-panel max-w-3xl mx-auto">
  <div class="card-body">
    <h1 class="card-title">Bootstrap Admin Guide</h1>
    <p class="opacity-80">Configure this in <strong>ournezt-core</strong> before first admin login.</p>

<pre class="bg-base-200 rounded p-3 text-sm overflow-x-auto"><code>BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@ournezt.local
BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_PASSWORD=TempPass123!
BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_DISPLAY_NAME=Bootstrap Admin</code></pre>

    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-sm space-y-1">
      <li>If no active admin exists, core creates/promotes this admin at startup.</li>
      <li>The admin must change password on first login.</li>
      <li>If an active admin already exists, bootstrap is skipped.</li>
    </ul>

    <a class="btn btn-primary mt-2 w-fit" href="/login">Back to login</a>
  </div>
</section>
{{ template "partials/footer" . }}
{{ end }}
